---
import { site } from '../../config/site';
---

<div class="introduciton">
  <p class="eyebrow">Hello there! I am..</p>
  <h1 class="page-hero">{site.author.alternateName}</h1>
  <p class="lead">Learning. Building. Securing. One vertex at a time.</p>
  <p class="intro-body">
    I am {site.author.alternateName}, though I usually go by {site.author.name}. AI Vertex is where
    I document what I'm building, breaking, and learning &mdash; a running record of my projects,
    experiments, and lessons along the way. Based in Toronto, I usually spend my weekends building
    something that probably didn't need to exist, playing video games, or dozing off.
  </p>
</div>

<style>
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: var(--text-label);
    color: var(--color-link);
    letter-spacing: 3px;
  }

  .page-hero {
    font-size: var(--text-display);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin: 20px 0 20px;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: var(--text-lead);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .intro-body {
    font-size: var(--text-body-small);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
